refused: d326_a_literal_too_long.cy:4:40, line 4 column 40
 4 |     let $name: str[len.max: 4 bytes] = "Tankun";
   |                                        ^^^^^^^^
 what: this text is 6 bytes, and `str[len.max: 4 bytes]` holds 4
 why:  a string's `len.max` is in bytes, and a literal that can't fit is a compile error (D326, D20)
